00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:00.030
Please watch the first episode of <i>In the Woods Beneath the Cherry Blossoms in Full Bloom</i>.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.410
Are you a mountain bandit?

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.660
If this was the sea, then I'd be a pirate.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.450
Bastard!

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:28.370
I'm not gonna kill you.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:31.580
I'll let you run away, but only if you strip naked.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:35.880
A bandit may be a bandit, but I'm a nice bandit.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:36.760
Understood?

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.720
The only thing I understood was that you said "bandit" a lot.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:43.510
But... I won't let you have your way!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.900
Just strip.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.450
Okay.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.780
Take that off too.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.660
Okay.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.540
You're bald?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.330
Sorry.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.880
Cherry blossoms are scary!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:12.640
They say that people swing bottles of booze and get drunk when the cherry blossom petals bloom.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:16.560
But a long time ago, no one considered cherry
blossoms to be a spectacular sight or anything.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:17.440
If you think I'm lying,

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.360
then think about it like taking people out of a lively environment.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.650
Don't you think the environment would turn grim?

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.380
A certain mother's beloved daughter got kidnapped.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:30.680
She went beneath the cherry blossoms in full bloom,

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.770
saw an illusion of her child in the shadows, and died.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:36.850
A pair of travelers left the other behind and fled at full speed.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.770
They could no longer trust each other's friendship.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.980
The cherry blossoms drove them all mad.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.600
Hey!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.480
I'm home!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.110
What's that, Shigemaru?

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.860
<i>What's in your bag?</i>

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.070
Well, take a look.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.450
Looks delicious!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.580
Looks delicious!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.500
Doesn't it look super delicious?!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.620
<i>It looks so delicious. </i>

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.250
Yeah, really.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.960
<i>Pork... is most favorite food in my life!</i>

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:45.880
Hold on!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.630
Don't treat people you just met as food!

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.550
It's rude, you idiots!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:53.890
But...

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.600
What a disgrace. What would your parents say?!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.600
I understand.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.650
Sorry, Boar.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:06.280
You don't like it when people call you delicious all of a sudden, right?

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.280
We were thoughtless.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.320
Sorry, Mister Boar.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:14.910
You can go home now!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:15.740
Thank you.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:17.830
Bye bye!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.120
You idiot!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.130
Why did you do that?!

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:27.800
Why did you let it go, you donkey!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.880
<i>All hope is gone!</i>

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:32.510
Because I felt sorry for him.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.760
Just because of that...

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:34.760
Stop it.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.890
I'll just catch another one.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.560
Stop fighting.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.060
I'm going to bed now.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.520
What happened?

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.980
You don't seem to be in a good mood, Shigemaru.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.030
Not really.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.450
Found them!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:21.180
There's nothing scary.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.390
It's just my imagination.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.510
What're you eating?!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.720
What're you listening to?!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.600
You're so noisy.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:03.230
Just listen to what I say.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:07.980
Hey.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.750
I'm not gonna kill you.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:35.260
I'll let you run away, but only if you strip naked.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:38.180
A bandit may be a bandit, but I'm a nice...

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.270
Is that your wife?

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.640
That's none of your business!

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:51.380
From today on, you'll be my wife.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.720
If I'm your wife, then carry me on your back.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.760
I can't walk on this mountain path.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:08.480
Carry me.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:17.990
<b>In the Woods
Beneath the
Cherry Blossoms
in Full Bloom</b>

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:24.030
Geez, weren't you walking a while ago?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.660
My hands are already shaking, mind getting off?

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:27.620
No way.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:31.000
If you drop me, I won't be your wife.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.290
I'll just go straight back to the city.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.790
The city?

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.670
So you're from the city.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:40.630
Yeah.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.590
Not from such empty mountains.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:44.890
Watch what you say.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:46.310
We've got everything here.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.770
The honey mushrooms, aralias and deer meat are all delicious.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:53.310
We don't need a water supply. There are springs everywhere that we can get water from all year round.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:57.820
If you saw how thick our brackens are, you'd be amazed and wonder if they're really brackens.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:02.280
What's so funny?

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.200
This must be amazing to you.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.780
Yeah, they're really thick.

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:09.040
That's great.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.250
Don't laugh.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.080
Listen.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:19.380
Everything you see, from the mountains to the trees
to the valleys to the clouds in those valleys, is mine.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:33.980
Are you listening?

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:34.730
All those mountains—

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.610
My hairpin fell.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.230
Oh, I see.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.820
So anyway, I said 'deer', but there's also bears—

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.490
You made my hairpin fall off!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:47.820
What's with you?

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:49.200
What're you getting so worked up about?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.370
Go pick it up.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.250
Huh?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.000
Everything in these mountains is yours, right?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.500
Then you should be able to get back my hairpin.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.670
Or can you only pick up brackens?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.510
So hurry up and go.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.680
If you don't, I won't be your wife.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.280
Ow...

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:17.330
A woman?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.630
He's got a woman with him.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.800
He's even carrying her on his back.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.630
It's going to get more crowded?

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.760
But take a look at her clothes.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.430
Aren't those from the city?

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.300
Really?

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.510
Where did he find her?

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.270
Here we are.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.400
I'm tired.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.610
Shigemaru, you're back?

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.440
What's with that woman?

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:50.320
Who are these women?

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.740
My... ex-wives.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.750
So these are your wives?

00:14:56.750 --> 00:15:02.420
Because I didn't know a woman as cute as you existed.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.350
No can do.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.770
Hey!

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:22.730
Who is right behind me~?

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.650
What are you doing?

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:30.990
I think that if I close my eyes,
those women will disappear on their own.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:35.080
Who is right behind me~?

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:40.160
They're not the kind of people who
would leave quietly if I told them to.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.960
That's not what I meant.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.670
Do you mind killing them?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.010
What's with you?

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:53.430
Do I really have to kill them?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.930
You killed my husband,

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.310
but you can't kill your own wives?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:02.810
If you don't, I won't be your wife.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.060
Stop.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.560
Leave her.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.190
I'll use her as my maid.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.570
Might as well finish off the job.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.150
Silly.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:15.650
I'm telling you not to kill her.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.900
It's... the same.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:02.870
The same as in those woods beneath the cherry blossoms in full bloom.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:39.030
This year, when the cherry blossoms bloom...

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:50.160
I'll boldly sit down right in the middle of the
cherry blossoms when they're in full bloom.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.170
What's this?! Can you really eat it?! Isn't it pig food?! It's disgusting!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:19:59.960
What the hell!

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.720
We can only eat this once every 10 days.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.970
No, no, I can't eat this!

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:04.890
Don't we have truffles?

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:05.260
If we have a pig, then we should have truffles too!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.760
It's a boar...

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:08.390
Of course we don't!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.770
Can't you at least do something about our food?

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:21.030
In these lonely mountains, all I can
hear through the long nights are owls.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:26.370
At least I had real food in the city.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:31.830
Hey Shigemaru, let's move to the city.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:36.670
If you're really a strong man, you'll take me to the city.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.210
Do you know what kind of wind the city has?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:44.340
Do you understand my feelings now that that wind has been taken from me?

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:49.180
Please wait three days.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.470
Three days?

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:53.350
What happens in three days?

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.440
The cherry blossoms will bloom.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:24.980
<b>In the Woods
Beneath the
Cherry Blossoms
in Full Bloom</b>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:30.010
